(4087474, 584710, 81664, '<td valign="top">Oh I love them!! how cute!! I hope your dog won!<br/> <br/>On the photo itself, I think I would love it more if it were cropped a bit tighter, to remove most of the gentlemen around the race box.</td>', 'Oh I love them!! how cute!! I hope your dog won! On the photo itself, I think I would love it more if it were cropped a bit tighter, to remove most of the gentlemen around the race box.', '2007-09-13 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
