(4090129, 583682, 82503, '<td valign="top">A step *back* in time? Not according to the timestamp. ;-) You should try and prevent your camera from writing the date on pictures. I guess this is a reason for a disqualification (both because you have text in the image and because you won''t be able to provide a file with the correct EXIF data).</td>', 'A step *back* in time? Not according to the timestamp. ;-) You should try and prevent your camera from writing the date on pictures. I guess this is a reason for a disqualification (both because you have text in the image and because you won''t be able to provide a file with the correct EXIF data).', '2007-09-14 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4090146, 585568, 82503, '<td valign="top">Good idea well realized. I like it.</td>', 'Good idea well realized. I like it.', '2007-09-14 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
