(4091658, 583682, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice backlit picture. Not sure how it fits the challenge Opening (opening a window to see the past?). It looks like your camera date was set wrong (year 2099). If so, it may very well get DQ''d because you can''t prove it was taken during the challenge dates. Make sure your camera date setting is right before taking pictures, and see if you can turn of the date stamp feature.  <br/> <br/>On the photo itself, I''d try straightening it so the right side of the mill is parallel to the side of the photo. The photo looks like it tilts to the right. The red building on the right doesn''t add to the nostalgic feel of the photo. Nice light reflections on the water in the river. What a great location this is - I could shoot all sorts of pictures there... <br/> <br/>Whatever happens on this picture, keep shooting. I''d love to see more of your work.</td>', 'Nice backlit picture. Not sure how it fits the challenge Opening (opening a window to see the past?). It looks like your camera date was set wrong (year 2099). If so, it may very well get DQ''d because you can''t prove it was taken during the challenge dates. Make sure your camera date setting is right before taking pictures, and see if you can turn of the date stamp feature.   On the photo itself, I''d try straightening it so the right side of the mill is parallel to the side of the photo. The photo looks like it tilts to the right. The red building on the right doesn''t add to the nostalgic feel of the photo. Nice light reflections on the water in the river. What a great location this is - I could shoot all sorts of pictures there...  Whatever happens on this picture, keep shooting. I''d love to see more of your work.', '2007-09-15 12:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091666, 584050, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your sky has some very noticeable "banding". There is nothing of interest in the quite dark foreground, and including that much foreground splits your picture in half. In this case, I''d go for 2/3 sky and 1/3 land. The sunrise colors (and size of sun) is nice.</td>', 'Your sky has some very noticeable "banding". There is nothing of interest in the quite dark foreground, and including that much foreground splits your picture in half. In this case, I''d go for 2/3 sky and 1/3 land. The sunrise colors (and size of sun) is nice.', '2007-09-15 12:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091669, 584990, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is very nice - a little dark, but it suits the mood of anticipation and look of concern on his face.</td>', 'This is very nice - a little dark, but it suits the mood of anticipation and look of concern on his face.', '2007-09-15 12:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091676, 585159, 77196, '<td valign="top">LOL! Something wrong about this just sitting on a table. I seem to remember these incidents with someone holding the bottle at arms length trying to keep from getting sprayed...</td>', 'LOL! Something wrong about this just sitting on a table. I seem to remember these incidents with someone holding the bottle at arms length trying to keep from getting sprayed...', '2007-09-15 12:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091679, 584123, 77196, '<td valign="top">Opening? This is a nice crop with excellent detail (including mom''s eyelashes) and a very nice DOF.</td>', 'Opening? This is a nice crop with excellent detail (including mom''s eyelashes) and a very nice DOF.', '2007-09-15 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091683, 584522, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection, with the optical illusion of the back left side of the puddle being an arch.</td>', 'Beautiful reflection, with the optical illusion of the back left side of the puddle being an arch.', '2007-09-15 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091689, 584908, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very narrow DOF leaves the white of the eye OOF while being (for me) in the top 3 foci of the shot.</td>', 'Very narrow DOF leaves the white of the eye OOF while being (for me) in the top 3 foci of the shot.', '2007-09-15 12:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091695, 585477, 77196, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Cute idea and nicely executed. The blue background is a bit intense, but is a nice contrast with the yellow "nest".</td>', 'Made me smile. Cute idea and nicely executed. The blue background is a bit intense, but is a nice contrast with the yellow "nest".', '2007-09-15 12:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091700, 582708, 77196, '<td valign="top">The mascara clumps don''t help you on this one. The reflection on the eye is a bit strong (don''t know what you can do about that - you''re taking a picture of a rounded shiny surface). I like the different angle. This makes me feel like I''m watching someone and am almost an intruder in the moment. Nice focus, DOF, &amp; lighting.</td>', 'The mascara clumps don''t help you on this one. The reflection on the eye is a bit strong (don''t know what you can do about that - you''re taking a picture of a rounded shiny surface). I like the different angle. This makes me feel like I''m watching someone and am almost an intruder in the moment. Nice focus, DOF, & lighting.', '2007-09-15 12:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091727, 583655, 77196, '<td valign="top">I want so much to like this picture. Great concept! The things that work against it (for me) is the lines running vertically on the left (cropping them out would not have hurt the picture), and that the photo isn''t level. Try leveling the river bank (or close to it), and removing the cables on the left and see if you like that better.</td>', 'I want so much to like this picture. Great concept! The things that work against it (for me) is the lines running vertically on the left (cropping them out would not have hurt the picture), and that the photo isn''t level. Try leveling the river bank (or close to it), and removing the cables on the left and see if you like that better.', '2007-09-15 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091730, 585351, 77196, '<td valign="top">A tad soft on the focus. Like the intensity of the near band member''s look. Nice colors (and there always has to be at least one clarinet that sticks out from the group - and one trumpet that is too loud...)</td>', 'A tad soft on the focus. Like the intensity of the near band member''s look. Nice colors (and there always has to be at least one clarinet that sticks out from the group - and one trumpet that is too loud...)', '2007-09-15 13:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091737, 585400, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, lighting, composition - really, really bad subject. They greyed out eyes (animal red eye?), major view of the tongue, and unidentifiable orange/brown item in the jaw (hot dog slice?) is repulsive. Worse, I am torn between feeling scared or just being grossed out by this. But your technique is so good... can I give two different scores?</td>', 'Nice capture, lighting, composition - really, really bad subject. They greyed out eyes (animal red eye?), major view of the tongue, and unidentifiable orange/brown item in the jaw (hot dog slice?) is repulsive. Worse, I am torn between feeling scared or just being grossed out by this. But your technique is so good... can I give two different scores?', '2007-09-15 13:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4091741, 585081, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love those seat covers!</td>', 'Love those seat covers!', '2007-09-15 13:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
