(4103456, 584522, 245, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, there''s all sorts of crazy stuff going on. It''s hard to pin down the angles of the rocks or the overall scale when looked at in detail, only by pulling back does the lay of the land make itself apparent, but by then it''s impossible to process all that info at once, so instead of seeing the image as a meaningful environment, there''s only an impression of the shape.<br/> <br/>And it is staring at me.<br/></td>', 'I love this shot, there''s all sorts of crazy stuff going on. It''s hard to pin down the angles of the rocks or the overall scale when looked at in detail, only by pulling back does the lay of the land make itself apparent, but by then it''s impossible to process all that info at once, so instead of seeing the image as a meaningful environment, there''s only an impression of the shape. And it is staring at me.', '2007-09-19 23:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4103515, 585573, 34462, '<td valign="top">Wow Jon, you beat your estimated score by a long shot. Way to go dude. Thanks for telling us about these guys. I never heard of conkers before. Interesting.</td>', 'Wow Jon, you beat your estimated score by a long shot. Way to go dude. Thanks for telling us about these guys. I never heard of conkers before. Interesting.', '2007-09-19 23:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
