(4103602, 585573, 67697, '<td valign="top">The colors and detail are beautifully captured.  For some reason I look at this and think "harvest".  I don''t think the photo is too busy but I would have preferred that the nut in the foreground be a little less prominent.  (i.e., next time, pick up that one and move it away lol).  Thanks for the conkers lesson, now I''d like to hear how you are supposed to play with them.  Congrats on beating your expected score!</td>', 'The colors and detail are beautifully captured.  For some reason I look at this and think "harvest".  I don''t think the photo is too busy but I would have preferred that the nut in the foreground be a little less prominent.  (i.e., next time, pick up that one and move it away lol).  Thanks for the conkers lesson, now I''d like to hear how you are supposed to play with them.  Congrats on beating your expected score!', '2007-09-20 00:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
