(4106743, 584522, 70484, '<td valign="top">Ignore the DNMC comments. I think that the imagination, creativity, and technical quality meets it perfectly. It really does look like you are standing in an otherworldly place waiting for the portal to open. What''s really cool is that the design in and around the water actually gives the illusion of the portal shimmering, hence, in the process of opening.<br/> <br/>Don''t let anyone take away the joy of your ribbon, you earned it with this picture. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Ignore the DNMC comments. I think that the imagination, creativity, and technical quality meets it perfectly. It really does look like you are standing in an otherworldly place waiting for the portal to open. What''s really cool is that the design in and around the water actually gives the illusion of the portal shimmering, hence, in the process of opening. Don''t let anyone take away the joy of your ribbon, you earned it with this picture. Very nicely done.', '2007-09-21 10:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
