(4113970, 584299, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect light, perfect color saturation, excellent focus and DOF - I can feel the flower from this - the texture and all.  A great shot!  Congrats on the new PB!</td>', 'Perfect light, perfect color saturation, excellent focus and DOF - I can feel the flower from this - the texture and all.  A great shot!  Congrats on the new PB!', '2007-09-25 03:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
