(4114470, 585400, 84576, '<td valign="top">I see by the spots that this fellow is either a Chow or, like my Red Fred who''s lying here by my side, has Chow in him. I don''t find this "gross" at all (last comment) but rather an exceptional capture. I don''t know how you managed to not only catch the treat in mid air but to get such an extraordinarily sharp shot with a digital camera. Amazing. I need to upgrade to an SLR and I will certainly be checking out the Nikon D80 if this is any example of what it can do in the right hands. Fantastic!</td>', 'I see by the spots that this fellow is either a Chow or, like my Red Fred who''s lying here by my side, has Chow in him. I don''t find this "gross" at all (last comment) but rather an exceptional capture. I don''t know how you managed to not only catch the treat in mid air but to get such an extraordinarily sharp shot with a digital camera. Amazing. I need to upgrade to an SLR and I will certainly be checking out the Nikon D80 if this is any example of what it can do in the right hands. Fantastic!', '2007-09-25 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
